ーサー味げんていで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカは1秒です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたらしい面がたくさん眠っている"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかんしかしない平尾ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのクセがなんかつよいのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカのお気に入り～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～♫ ﾃﾚﾚﾚ ﾃｯﾃｯﾃｰ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この某ゲームネタがいつまでつづくか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんでぜひ見守ってください～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nまいにちこうしんしてるポカが\nそろそろほめてほしそうなカオを\nしている・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ほめる\nほめない\nしごとだからあたりまえだろ\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は平岡のごしょうかい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-65532":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜🔔*゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202508/mob1jOYlb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！日向坂46  金村美玖です🎻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画像に色々書きすぎて情報過多ですね…笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の伝えたいことはもう\nこの1枚にまとまっております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨夜0:00から「お願いバッハ！」の\n先行配信がスタートされました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうお聴きいただけたでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ感想などは\n『#日向坂46_お願いバッハ』で\nつぶやいてくださ